{"title":"Thak Warlord","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 75 Thak that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1234.3px,-81.8px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/3/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/3/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/4/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/4/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:1234.3px;top:81.8px\"></i></div><figcaption>Plymouth Wharf</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"thak-warlord\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Thak: <a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-spearman\">Thak Spearman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-shieldbearer\">Thak Shieldbearer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(56)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-reaver\">Thak Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/thak-veteran\">Thak Veteran</a> <span class=\"muted\">(68)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/3dc2e11a5fe42631c1b7.webp\" alt=\"Thak Warlord\"></div><h3>Thak Warlord</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>75</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 75)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Thak</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>560</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>45.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,750</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}